#question(title: [Challenge - 2])[
  We want to calculate the value of
  $
    sum_(n = 0)^oo ((- 1)^n)/((2 n + 1) thin 3^n)
  $

  #box(width: 1fr, line(length: 100%, stroke: .5pt))

  #set enum(spacing: .55em + 0.5cm)
  + Write $display(F(x) = arctan x)$ as a
    power series.
     #v(0.5cm)

     #emph[Hint:] Compute $display(F' (x))$.
     Using the geometric series, write
     $display(F' (x))$ as a series. Then
     integrate.
  + Now calculate the original sum.
]
